 "description": "The Pansarvärnskanonvagn III (Pvkv III) was an experimental self-propelled gun developed in the early 1950s. It was based on the chassis of the obsolete Strv m/41 tank. Converting it into the Pvkv III involved installing a new turret with a 57 mm Pvkan m/43 gun. This was intended as a temporary measure until the Lansen tank and other, more advanced vehicles appeared. However, the self-propelled gun, like its counterpart the Pvkv II , did not appeal to the Swedish military. Instead, they decided to purchase British Centurions , which had superior armament and armor. The Pvkv III was introduced in Update 2.17 \"Danger Zone\" . It has weak armor, but a powerful gun with a good rate of fire.",
